## Data Summary

The data used in this study were obtained from the National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration, specifically the Storm Prediction Center Tornado Database. This data set includes all recorded tornado events in the United States from 1950 to 2024, along with variables such as location, starting and ending coordinates, magnitude, and date of occurrence. A summary table of the data set is provided below.


